OL,3,AMicrosoft struggling to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting thousands of users
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft is struggling to fix a global
OL,7,Foutage of its service that is
OL,8,Freportedly affecting tens of thousands
OL,9,Fof users
OL,11,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,12,FMicrosoft's AI software Copilot have
OL,13,Fbeen affected by "connectivity
OL,14,Fproblems"
OL,16,FThe company has said that its attempts
OL,17,Fto fix the issue are not "taking as
OL,18,Fexpected" - it had earlier said it said
OL,19,Fits team is "seeing positive results"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
