OL,3,AMicrosoft struggling to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting thousands of users
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issue, according to Microsoft, is
OL,7,Fthat its infrastructure is
OL,8,F"experiencing elevated load across
OL,9,Fmultiple regions" - this usually means
OL,10,Fthat the company's servers are under
OL,11,Fheavy strain that affects its ability
OL,12,Fto operate
